ity campuses.\n\n⸻\n\nThe Room\n\nThe room is fully furnished and ready for immediate move-in:\n\t•\tComfortable bed\n\t•\tSpacious wardrobe\n\t•\tDesk and chair – ideal for studying or working from home\n\t•\tBright, clean layout with modern furnishings\n\nA practical and cozy private space within a structured shared living environment.\n\n⸻\n\nShared Apartment\n\nThe apartment is shared with 3 other residents (mixed gender), creating a balanced and respectful co-living atmosphere.\n\nCommon areas include:\n\t•\tFully equipped kitchen with all essential appliances\n\t•\tBathroom + separate toilet for convenience\n\t•\tWashing machine available\n\t•\tCentral heating and high-speed WiFi\n\n⸻\n\nLocation & Surroundings\n\nGarching is known for its quiet, green environment while being closely connected to Munich’s key business and university hubs.\n\nNearby highlights:\n\t•\tTUM Campus Garching – approx. 5–8 minutes by bike / 10 min public transport\n\t•\tGarching city center – approx. 5–10 min (supermarkets, cafés, restaurants)\n\t•\tGarching Forschungszentrum area – major research and tech hub\n\t•\tGreen open spaces and walking paths in the immediate surroundings\n\nThis location is especially popular among students, researchers, and professionals.\n\n⸻\n\nPublic Transport\n\nThe apartment offers excellent public transport connections:\n\t•\tU-Bahn Garching (U6) – approx. 8–12 min walk / short bus ride\n→ Direct connection to TUM, LMU, and Munich city center (Marienplatz)\n\t•\tBus connections (e.g. lines 290, 292) – approx. 3–5 min walk\n\t•\tFast access to the A9 motorway\n\nThis ensures quick and reliable commuting across Munich and the surrounding areas.\n\n⸻\n\nWhy Choose This Room\n\t•\tQuiet and well-connected location near TUM\n\t•\tFully furnished and ready to move in\n\t•\tStructured and respectful co-living environment\n\t•\tIdeal for students, interns, and professionals\n\n⸻\n\nOur Service\n\t•\tOne of the largest providers of furnished rentals in Munich\n\t•\tLocal, experienced support team\n\t•\tMultilingual communication\n\t•\tFast response times\n\t•\tIn-house handyman service\n\t•\tProfessional handover process","facilities":{"bathroom":{"value":"shared_w_both"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomSize":{"value":"12"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"no"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"gas"},"housematesGender":{"value":"shared_w_both"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"shared"},"kitchenware":{"value":"shared"},"livingRoom":{"value":"shared"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"discussable"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"outside_only"},"toilet":{"value":"shared"},"totalSize":{"value":"100"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":79500,"deposit":159000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"795.00","deposit":"1590.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":3,"moveInWindow":30,"currentOccupancy":4,"minAge":18,"maxAge":35,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2026-05-01"}],"updated":"2026-04-13T12:14:59Z","__utId__":"ut1694571"}]